    "chunk_text": "Luna prima; omnibus rebus agendis utilis est mona se forma; on eallum \u00feingum dondum nytlic ys. Puer natus erit illustris, astutus, sapiens, litteratus, in aqua periclitatus; si euaserit, longeuus erit cild Puella nata intemerata, casta, benigna, speciosa, uiris placens, \u00ebque discernens; in postera \u00ebtate erit in Signum habet in ore uel in supercilio tacen heo hef\u00f0 on mu\u00f0e o\u00f0\u00f0e on bruan. Qui recumbit, longe languescit se\u00fee bi\u00f0, lange he handla\u00f0. Quicquid somniauerit, in gaudium conuertetur, quia neque malum, raro bonum significat swaw\u00e6tswa & sanguinem minuere tota die luna bona est & blod l\u00e6tan o\u00f0\u00f0e wanian ealne d\u00e6g mona god ys. Luna II; omnibus rebus agendis utilis est; emere, uendere, nauim ascendere mona se o\u00f0er, on eallum Puer natus sapiens, benignus, astutus, fexis cild acenned wis, milde, geap, ges\u00e6lig. Puella similiter m\u00e6den eallswa. Qui iacet, cito conualescit se\u00fee li\u00f0, ra\u00f0e acofra\u00f0. Somnium non habet effectum swefen n\u00e6f\u00f0 gefremincge. Non est bona luna sanguinem minuere nys na god mona blod wanian. Luna III; opera incipere non congruit, nisi quod renascitur stirpare, animalia domare, uerres castrare Hortum non seras, quia uari\u00eb herb\u00eb nascuntur wyrttun na saw \u00feu, for\u00fei ydele wyrta beo\u00f0 accennede. Quod furatur, cito inuenitur \u00fe\u00e6t bi\u00f0 forstolen, ra\u00fee he bi\u00f0 fund",
